      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I realize the smaller ears are harder to see. Here is another example of the animated ears effect. These ears were also smoothly animated in 3.2.0 and worked fine within Unity, but ever since updating to 3.2.1 the animations seem to \"lock\" the physbones.\n\nNew Unity SDK: https://i.gyazo.com/88b44f63dc542b606b03a6f60a5c3589.mp4\n\nVRChat and 3.2.0 SDK:\n\nhttps://i.gyazo.com/282db291a44089ddb4a39463d853c6e4.mp4",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
